// Part 12
// Method Abstraction Review
//
// gcd(...)
//
// The caller needs to know that it takes two numbers and returns
// their greatest common divisor. The caller does not need to know
// how the GCD is calculated.
//
// isPrime(...)
//
// The caller needs to know that it checks if a number is prime.
// The caller does not need to know how the method checks it.
//
// hexToDecimal(...)
//
// The caller needs to know that it converts hexadecimal to decimal.
// The caller does not need to know how the conversion works.
//
// max(...)
//
// The caller needs to know that it returns the largest value.
// The caller does not need to know how the values are compared.


